    "These are exploratory development covariance diagnostics, not a transportable final design effect. Panel weights and root eligibility differ.",
    "Bootstrap intervals condition on estimated cell means; they omit adaptation, oracle uncertainty and sparse-cell mean fitting uncertainty.",
    "Raw pair correlations confound differing cell difficulty; use residual results as a sensitivity, not a causal explanation.",
    "Astra04 alone has no repeated aorist pair within family; no Astra repeated-aorist correlation is inferred from these Opus estimates."
